# Review the handoff

Before any edit, review the Linear page [Agent handoff](https://linear.app/digital-zine/document/agent-handoff-186930851c71).

- It lists work already in the tree and decisions the owner has made. Do not rebuild that work, and do not reopen those decisions.
- It names the active Linear project. Read the open issues there before starting a second ticket.
- If this page and the code disagree, trust the code, then correct the page.
- The page stays the current state. Done tickets stay in Linear. Delete a row when its ticket is Done. Do not add a Done table.
- Session history goes on [Agent handoff log](https://linear.app/digital-zine/document/agent-handoff-log-b0673a41c909). Before you stop, replace "Latest session" on the handoff page and append one row to the log. Times are America/New_York. Do not read the log before editing, and do not copy older rows back.
- Do not recreate `docs/agent-handoff.md`. Status does not belong in the repository.
